7":"FLAMETHROWER\\n10,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00018":"ICE BEAM\\n10,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00019":"THUNDERBOLT\\n10,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00020":"SILK SCARF\\n1,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00021":"WIDE LENS\\n1,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00022":"ZOOM LENS\\n1,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00023":"METRONOME\\n1,000 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00024":"ABRA{CURSOR_X 103}200 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00025":"EKANS{CURSOR_X 103}700 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00026":"DRATINI{CURSOR_X 90}2,100 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00027":"SANDSHREW{CURSOR_X 103}700 Coins","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00028":"My name is Mr. Game!\\rMy heart pounds with excitement when\\npeople enjoy my Coin game!\\rIn fact, that’s what I live for!\\nYou look like quite a challenger!\\rWhy don’t you play my Coin game?\\rYou can get fabulous prizes if\\nyou manage to collect a lot\\fof Coins. {YESNO 0}","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00029":"","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00030":"","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00031":"All right!\\nHere is your Coin Case!\\r","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00032":"Show me how you play, and my heart\\nwill pound with excitement!\\r","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00033":"Playing my Coin game will make your\\nheart and my heart both pound with\\fexcitement, you know?","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00034":"My name is Mr. Game!\\rMy heart pounds with excitement when\\npeople enjoy my Coin game!\\rIn fact, that’s what I live for!\\nGo ahead and play it!\\rMake my heart pound with excitement!","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00035":"Go ahead and play my Coin game!\\fMake my heart pound with excitement!","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00036":"What a feeling!\\rNothing beats Coin-game spectatorship!\\nOh! I almost forgot!\\rYou can exchange your Coins for prizes\\nwith the two gentlemen at the table\\fover there.","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00037":"Did you come back to play\\nmy Coin game?","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00038":"It seems you need a Coin Case\\nto play...\\r","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00039":"Mr. Game: Aha!\\rYou must be here to play my Coin game!\\nCome here and I’ll give you a Coin Case!","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00040":"Mr. Game: Show me how you play and\\nmake my heart pound with excitement!\\r","msg_0603_T25SP0101_00041":"Mr. Game: Huh?\\rWhy don’t you sit across from me\\nand show me how you play?"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T25SP0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T25SP0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T25SP0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T25SP0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T25SP0101_004":4,"obj_T25SP0101_suit":0,"obj_T25SP0101_gsgentleman":1,"obj_T25SP0101_gsgentleman_2":2}}
